OL,4,CBreeder who claimed he sold dogs to    
OL,5,Cthe Kardashians jailed for cropping    
OL,6,Cpuppies' ears                          
OL,7,GA dog breeder who claimed to have sold 
OL,8,Gdogs to celebrities and was followed   
OL,9,Gon social media by Snoop Dogg has been 
OL,10,Gsentenced to two years in prison for   
OL,11,Gmutilating the ears of bulldog         
OL,12,Gpuppies, a court has heard.            
OL,14,FEugene Vatsaloo, 57, from Tonyrefail   
OL,15,Fin Rhondda Cynon Taf, was convicted of 
OL,16,F13 offences including the illegal      
OL,17,Fprocedure of cropping the ears of      
OL,18,Fpocket bullies to follow a social      
OL,19,Fmedia trend.                           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
