OL,4,CCatherine's cancer documentary makes   
OL,5,Cme feel less alone, says Strictly's    
OL,6,CAmy Dowden                             
OL,7,GStrictly Come Dancing's Amy Dowden     
OL,8,Gsays the upcoming documentary from     
OL,9,GCatherine, the Princess of Wales,      
OL,10,Gabout her cancer journey will help     
OL,11,Gmany people, including herself, "not   
OL,12,Gfeel so alone".                        
OL,14,FDowden praised the documentary and     
OL,15,Fsaid it confirmed how "anyone can be   
OL,16,Fdealt the devastating blow of a cancer 
OL,17,Fdiagnosis".                            
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
