OL,4,CWeak and immature management putting   
OL,5,Cpatients at risk at failing health     
OL,6,Cboard, review finds                    
OL,7,GWales' largest health board is still   
OL,8,Gfailing, with "fundamental weaknesses" 
OL,9,Gin governance and management, a new    
OL,10,Greport says.                           
OL,12,FBetsi Cadwaladr University Health      
OL,13,FBoard has been in special measures for 
OL,14,Fnine years in total, with the latest   
OL,15,Fperiod starting in 2023.               
OL,17,FA review of its leadership published   
OL,18,Fon Tuesday found, in some parts,       
OL,19,Ftargets and money "have a greater      
OL,20,Fpriority for senior management than    
OL,21,Fthe quality and safety of care".       
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
